### login with default user
## default user: "username", "password"
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "username",
  "password": "password"
}

### login with default admin user
## default admin: "admin", "password"
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

